<title>JAPAN: S'tomo Chem discussing tie-up with Mitsu Toatsu.</title>
<headline>S'tomo Chem discussing tie-up with Mitsu Toatsu.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Chemical Co Ltd said on Monday that it is discussing a possible tie-up in the polystyrene business with Mitsui Toatsu Chemicals Inc.</p>
</text>
